@baseUrl = http://localhost:5224
@mcpToken = REPLACE_WITH_SECRET
@managementToken = REPLACE_WITH_DIFFERENT_SECRET
@administratorSession = REPLACE_WITH_SHORT_LIVED_SESSION

### Shared administrator login capabilities (public metadata only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth/capabilities

### Request an administrator email code (generic response for unapproved addresses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth/request-code
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"administrator@example.com"}

### Verify a code; never log or share the response token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"administrator@example.com","code":"REPLACE_WITH_CODE"}

### Current approved administrator and expiry
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{administratorSession}}

### Initialize the authenticated, stateless MCP endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"hotel-manual-check","version":"1.0"}}}

### Discover read-only tools
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list","params":{}}

### List canonical approved documents
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"list_knowledge","arguments":{"limit":20}}}

### Capabilities (no token required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/capabilities

### Inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/blocks
X-Knowledge-Token: {{managementToken}}

### Full extracted preview (missing paths return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/preview?path=uploads/notes.txt
X-Knowledge-Token: {{managementToken}}

### Original (legacy originals may be unavailable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/original?path=uploads/notes.txt
X-Knowledge-Token: {{managementToken}}

### Rebuild the index; uses the embedding deployment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/rebuild
X-Knowledge-Token: {{managementToken}}

### Approve any document, regardless of its historical source path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/documents/approve?path=uploads/notes.txt
X-Knowledge-Token: {{managementToken}}

### Explicitly destructive: delete a document and its search blocks
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/documents?path=uploads/notes.txt
X-Knowledge-Token: {{managementToken}}
